; ==============================================================================
; OpenWebNet WHO 16 Sound System: Source Device & Interface Protocol Suite
; Target Endpoints: Legrand/BTicino L4561N, L4561, 3482, F500 FM Tuner
; Standard Address Space: 101..109 (Sources 1..9), 100 (Collective / Cycle)
; ==============================================================================

; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; 1. Source Power Control (Stereo Channel WHAT=3/13 vs Base Band WHAT=0/10)
; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Source 1..4 Power ON (Stereo Channel WHAT=3)
down *16*3*101##
down *16*3*102##
down *16*3*103##
down *16*3*104##

; Source 1..4 Standby / Power OFF (Stereo Channel WHAT=13)
down *16*13*101##
down *16*13*102##
down *16*13*103##
down *16*13*104##

; Legacy Base Band Control (WHAT=0 ON, WHAT=10 OFF)
down *16*0*101##
down *16*0*102##
down *16*10*101##
down *16*10*102##

; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; 2. Source Cycling & Busy Signaling
; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Cycle to next active source across entire plant (WHERE=100)
down *16*23*100##
down *16*20*100##

; Source Busy state broadcast (WHAT=100)
down *16*100*101##
down *16*100*102##

; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; 3. Track and Station Navigation (WHAT 6001..6015 / 6101..6115)
; Triggers L4561N IR emitter pulses to external Hi-Fi / CD / Tuner
; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Forward step 1 (Next track / station)
down *16*6001*101##
down *16*6001*102##

; Forward multi-step (2, 5, 10, 15)
down *16*6002*101##
down *16*6002*102##
down *16*6005*101##
down *16*6005*102##
down *16*6010*102##
down *16*6015*102##

; Backward step 1 (Previous track / station)
down *16*6101*101##
down *16*6101*102##

; Backward multi-step (2, 5, 10, 15)
down *16*6102*101##
down *16*6102*102##
down *16*6105*101##
down *16*6105*102##
down *16*6110*102##
down *16*6115*102##

; Boundary tests: Invalid step values (should be NACKed or rejected)
down *16*6000*102##
down *16*6016*102##
down *16*6100*102##
down *16*6116*102##

; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; 4. Tuner Frequency Seeking & Stepping (WHAT 5000..5015 / 5100..5115)
; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Seek next free station up / down
down *16*5000*101##
down *16*5100*101##

; Step frequency up by 0.05 MHz (1 step) .. 0.50 MHz (10 steps)
down *16*5001*101##
down *16*5005*101##
down *16*5010*101##

; Step frequency down by 0.05 MHz (1 step) .. 0.50 MHz (10 steps)
down *16*5101*101##
down *16*5105*101##
down *16*5110*101##

; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; 5. Dimension 5: Status Discovery
; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Query status of specific source devices
down *#16*101*5##
down *#16*102*5##
down *#16*103*5##
down *#16*104*5##

; Query collective source status
down *#16*100*5##

; Query general plant sound state
down *#16*0*5##

; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; 6. Dimension 6: Tuner Frequency
; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Frequency request
down *#16*101*6##
down *#16*102*6##

; Frequency direct write (107.00 MHz = 107000 kHz, 98.50 MHz = 098500 kHz)
down *#16*101*#6*0*107000##
down *#16*101*#6*0*98500##
down *#16*102*#6*0*101500##

; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; 7. Dimension 7 & 10: Stored Station / Track Presets
; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Stored station query
down *#16*101*7##
down *#16*102*7##

; Recall stored station 1..5 via Dimension 7 write
down *#16*101*#7*0*1##
down *#16*101*#7*0*2##
down *#16*101*#7*0*3##
down *#16*101*#7*0*4##
down *#16*101*#7*0*5##

; Memorize current station into preset 1..5 via Dimension 10 write
down *#16*101*#10*1##
down *#16*101*#10*3##
down *#16*101*#10*5##

; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; 8. Dimension 8: RDS Text Feed
; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Request RDS text
down *#16*101*8##
down *#16*102*8##

; Start / Stop RDS automatic transmission (WHAT 101 / 102)
down *16*101*101##
down *16*102*101##
down *16*101*102##
down *16*102*102##

; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; 9. Dimension 9: Frequency + Preset Compound Query
; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
down *#16*101*9##
down *#16*102*9##

; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; 10. Matrix Environment Routing (1ES Syntax: Environment E -> Source S)
; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Route Environment 1 to Source 1 and Source 2
down *16*3*111##
down *16*3*112##

; Route Environment 2 to Source 2 and Source 3
down *16*3*122##
down *16*3*123##
